{
    "title": "Metalstorm",
    "description": "Metalstorm is the ultimate air combat and shooting game experience. As a pilot, take control of powerful fighter jets and aircraft, mastering flying in intense air combat battles. Whether you\u2019re into shooting games, airplane games, or a real flight simulator, Metalstorm offers the best of all worlds.\r\n\r\nEngage in thrilling air attack missions and prove your skills in a dogfight as the top pilot. Fly legendary jets and warplanes, dominate the skies, and experience the excitement of an air attack in this action game. If you\u2019re looking for the best flying, shooting, and air combat simulator, Metalstorm has it all!\r\n\r\nBecome a Skilled Pilot and Rule the Skies\r\n\r\nIn Metalstorm, you\u2019ll fly legendary fighter jets like the F-16 Fighting Falcon, F-35 Lightning II, F-22 Raptor, A-10 Thunderbolt II, Su-57 Felon, F/A-18 Hornet, and MiG-29 Fulcrum. Whether you love shooting games or real flight simulator, this action game offers an unmatched experience in flying and combat.\r\n\r\nJoin epic 5v5 multiplayer battles and team up with friends. Prove your skills as a pilot and take on real opponents from around the world in fast-paced, action-packed air combat.\r\n\r\nUpgrade and Customize Your Aircraft\r\n\r\nUnlock 31 unique planes, each with its own strengths. Upgrade your aircraft with special abilities and customize them with unique paint jobs and decals. Master your flying skills as a pilot and dominate the skies with powerful fighter jets and warplanes.\r\n\r\nEvery jet attack move in Metalstorm brings the realism of a real flight simulator combined with the thrill of airplane games.\r\n\r\nExperience Intense Air Attack Missions\r\n\r\nJoin the sky warriors from the Air Force and lead air attacks against powerful enemies. Metalstorm\u2019s realistic physics and immersive flight mechanics make it one of the top action games for fans of shooting games and air combat. Whether piloting a modern jet or classic warplane, every battle is intense and exciting.\r\n\r\nCompete in real-time PvP battles, climb the leaderboards, and earn exclusive rewards. Join a squadron and participate in weekly events to showcase your flying and air combat skills. Dominate the skies with your fighter jets and become an ace pilot in the Air Force!\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n- Fly legendary jets like F-16, F-35, F-22, and MiG-29.\r\n- Realistic air combat in a real flight simulator experience.\r\n- Intense 5v5 multiplayer battles against global players.\r\n- Unlock and upgrade 31 aircraft across 20 levels.\r\n- Customize your planes with special abilities, paint jobs, and decals.\r\n- Multiple game modes: Team Deathmatch, Air Supremacy, Elimination.\r\n- Stunning maps: desert canyons, icebergs, volcanic islands.\r\n- Join a squadron and earn rewards in weekly events.\r\n\r\nWhy Choose Metalstorm for Air Combat and Action Games?\r\n\r\nMetalstorm offers the perfect mix of real flight simulation, shooting games, and airplane games. Fly fighter jets, master your flying skills, and engage in fast-paced dogfights. If you love warplanes, aircraft action, and being a pilot, this game delivers an unforgettable experience.\r\n\r\nBecome part of the Air Force\u2019s elite sky warriors, lead air attacks, and dominate as a top ace pilot. Whether you\u2019re a fan of airplane games or action games, Metalstorm has everything you need.\r\n\r\nDownload Metalstorm and Take Control Now\r\n\r\nDon\u2019t miss out on one of the best shooting games and airplane simulators. Master your flying skills, upgrade your aircraft, and engage in thrilling air combat against players worldwide. Download Metalstorm today and dominate the skies with your fighter jets.\r\n\r\nGet ready for the ultimate air combat and real flight simulator experience. Play now and become the top ace pilot!\r\n\r\nStay Connected:\r\n\r\nDiscord: http://metalstorm.gg/discord\r\nTikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@playmetalstorm\r\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/playmetalstorm\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/playmetalstorm\r\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/playmetalstorm",
    "descriptionHTML": "Metalstorm is the ultimate air combat and shooting game experience. As a pilot, take control of powerful fighter jets and aircraft, mastering flying in intense air combat battles. Whether you\u2019re into shooting games, airplane games, or a real flight simulator, Metalstorm offers the best of all worlds.<br><br>Engage in thrilling air attack missions and prove your skills in a dogfight as the top pilot. Fly legendary jets and warplanes, dominate the skies, and experience the excitement of an air attack in this action game. If you\u2019re looking for the best flying, shooting, and air combat simulator, Metalstorm has it all!<br><br>Become a Skilled Pilot and Rule the Skies<br><br>In Metalstorm, you\u2019ll fly legendary fighter jets like the F-16 Fighting Falcon, F-35 Lightning II, F-22 Raptor, A-10 Thunderbolt II, Su-57 Felon, F/A-18 Hornet, and MiG-29 Fulcrum. Whether you love shooting games or real flight simulator, this action game offers an unmatched experience in flying and combat.<br><br>Join epic 5v5 multiplayer battles and team up with friends. Prove your skills as a pilot and take on real opponents from around the world in fast-paced, action-packed air combat.<br><br>Upgrade and Customize Your Aircraft<br><br>Unlock 31 unique planes, each with its own strengths. Upgrade your aircraft with special abilities and customize them with unique paint jobs and decals. Master your flying skills as a pilot and dominate the skies with powerful fighter jets and warplanes.<br><br>Every jet attack move in Metalstorm brings the realism of a real flight simulator combined with the thrill of airplane games.<br><br>Experience Intense Air Attack Missions<br><br>Join the sky warriors from the Air Force and lead air attacks against powerful enemies. Metalstorm\u2019s realistic physics and immersive flight mechanics make it one of the top action games for fans of shooting games and air combat. Whether piloting a modern jet or classic warplane, every battl